# ===[ Game files ]===
#
# UNDERTALE is a commercial game. Nothing that came out of it goes in here: not the
# data.win, not the audio, not the texture pack built from it. The port is the code that
# runs the game; the game itself stays on the disk you bought it from.
data.win
*.ogg
*.wtex
dist/
*/slots/

# ===[ Other people's projects ]===
#
# These were downloaded to read, not written here, and each carries its own licence.
# Butterscotch is what Cinnamon forked from; GRRLIB brings up video; the rest are Wii
# tools and someone else's attempt at the same port. None of them belong in this history.
Butterscotch-main/
GRRLIB-4.6.1/
customizemii-master/
wad-manager-master/
undertale-wii-da-github/
*.zip

